team/apps/2814720/extras/774912ba56018831182c35864533acda.poster.avif?t=1759480268\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814720/extras/774912ba56018831182c35864533acda.webm?t=1759480268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814720/extras/774912ba56018831182c35864533acda.mp4?t=1759480268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a02 [Harem System]<br>Your exclusive harem, intimate with multiple beautiful NPCs; Temporarily increase hero attack power through special interactive methods~\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814720/extras/ce2cb671cbaa781557cff352f2e4fe1a.poster.avif?t=1759480268\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814720/extras/ce2cb671cbaa781557cff352f2e4fe1a.webm?t=1759480268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814720/extras/ce2cb671cbaa781557cff352f2e4fe1a.mp4?t=1759480268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\u3010 Multi instance System \u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > BOSS Battlefield: A large number of junior bosses can freely brush advanced equipment; Elite Battlefield: A large number of elite players upgrade materials and rare items; Conventional Battlefield: Experience points, unlimited drop of primary materials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814720/extras/91731389f1a298c750b8522af90b1120.poster.avif?t=1759480268\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814720/extras/91731389f1a298c750b8522af90b1120.webm?t=1759480268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814720/extras/91731389f1a298c750b8522af90b1120.mp4?t=1759480268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 [favorability system]<br>Frequently interacting with NPCs, there is a chance that they will appear on the battlefield during your battles and release skills to assist you in your battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5\u3010 Reincarnation Mode \u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > After killing the ultimate boss and replacing him as the new ruler of the underworld, the character can reincarnate and unlock new characters to continue challenging new hegemony. After each round of challenges, the overall difficulty of the game will increase by 20%!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6\u3010 Plot and Story System \u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 500 main storyline levels, 7 major storyline bosses, 50+regular bosses, and nearly a hundred elite types; The main storyline, storyline, treasure dungeons, and character rotation system allow the game to be played infinitely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814720/extras/16e8fef4689b98b90438540bbbd65656.poster.avif?t=1759480268\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814720/extras/16e8fef4689b98b90438540bbbd65656.webm?t=1759480268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814720/extras/16e8fef4689b98b90438540bbbd65656.mp4?t=1759480268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7\u3010 Unlimited Upgrade System \u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fast upgrade, up to level 1000; Can face stronger bosses and challenges from elite monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8\u3010Evolutionary System\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > When a character reaches a certain level, it can evolve into a high-level skeleton, and skills can evolve together. Skills and character growth will also evolve with it! The combat power of evolved heroes has been greatly enhanced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9\u3010 Mild Roque gameplay \u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Random upgrade rewards, random boss kill rewards, random maps, random monster types, random monster types~; Every time I challenge myself after reincarnation, my feelings are different</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10\u3010Equipment System\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinguish equipment colors and enhancement levels, types of accessory damage, unlimited equipment enhancement levels, use enhancement stones and rare equipment to create super divine equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814720/extras/9da32c44c30023df82fa16e847556a5c.poster.avif?t=1759480268\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814720/extras/9da32c44c30023df82fa16e847556a5c.webm?t=1759480268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814720/extras/9da32c44c30023df82fa16e847556a5c.mp4?t=1759480268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11\u3010 Achievement System \u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Display in the reincarnation room: number of monsters killed, number of elites killed, number of bosses killed, reincarnation level, and number of beautiful women in the harem. Enable you to achieve success and satisfaction in the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12\u3010 Special World Setting \u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The character was born in the underworld, also known as the underworld. The world is built by death and soul. Here, you can meet famous figures from any period in history, and even conquer them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2814720?t=1759480268","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814720/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759480268","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814720/4db3f11ba3c141bd86283241f6fb67fff20b6ed4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759480268","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814720/4db3f11ba3c141bd86283241f6fb67fff20b6ed4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759480268","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814720/extras/e3a172438ecff44954c8f16a9f223ac1.avif?t=1759480268\" width=616 height=332 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814720/extras/519432b488bf2b59e74819b9292031b2.avif?t=1759480268\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814720/e